  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project of Marine Plastic Debris Mitigation by Recycling River Waste in the Republic of Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1-1. River trash boom and collection facilities 1-1-1. Geotechnical site investigation 1-1-2. Design and installation of trash boom 1-1-3. Trash boom operation and river waste collection 1.2. River Waste Pre-treatment and Recycling Facilities 1-2-1. Design and installation of River trash pre-treatment and recycling Facilities  1-2-2. Operation post-treatment and recycling facility 1-2-3. Policy Recommendation on Value Chain Integration of River Waste Recycling 2-1. Capacity development program 2-2-1. On-site training for operators  2-2-2. Policy-makers Invitational Training Program 2-2-3. Public Awareness program</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute for the achievement of the Indonesian government&apos;s policy goal such as 70 percent reduction in marine debris by blocking the inflow of plastic waste into the ocean through rivers&#x25A3; &#xD558;&#xCC9C;&#xC744; &#xD1B5;&#xD55C; &#xD50C;&#xB77C;&#xC2A4;&#xD2F1; &#xD3D0;&#xAE30;&#xBB3C;&#xC758; &#xD574;&#xC591; &#xC720;&#xC785; &#xCC28;&#xB2E8;&#xACFC; &#xC218;&#xAC70;&#xB41C; &#xD558;&#xCC9C;&#xC4F0;&#xB808;&#xAE30; &#xC7AC;&#xD65C;&#xC6A9; &#xD6A8;&#xC728;&#xC131; &#xBC0F; &#xC6B4;&#xC601; &#xC9C0;&#xC18D;&#xAC00;&#xB2A5;&#xC131; &#xD5A5;&#xC0C1;</narrative>
  </description>
